      "text": "Happiness has been defined in very different ways throughout history. For some ancient philosophers, it consisted of avoiding pain and seeking peace of mind. For others, it was inseparable from virtue and the fulfillment of duty. Perhaps there is no single answer, but as many as people who try to find it.",
